<title>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达1</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:00:44 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”</b><br/><br/>人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达10.79亿人，但“现在还有一些人没有参保”，要通过“数据找人”等方式动员参保，力争“十五五”期间养老参保率稳定在95%以上。<br/><br/>他称重点是鼓励灵活就业人员、农民工和新就业形态人员参加职工养老保险，并建立用工方、平台企业和劳动者分担缴费的机制。<br/><br/>相关话题登上微博热搜。有博主指“灵活就业群体交房租、吃饭都把钱分完了，社保自然排后面”。据路透社7月报道指，非强制缴纳社保零工岗位激增，加剧了资金本就不足的社保所面临的长期风险。记者访问了12名灵活就业人员，只有2名愿意交社保，有受访者称：“我可以自己掌控，而不是苦等几十年让别人给我发钱”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D">#社保</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%89%93%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA">#打工人</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《新浪财经》<a href="https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-10-10/doc-iniutyyz2044159.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人社部：要把未参保人员找到动员参保</a><br/>《新浪微博》<a href="https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5352537697552192.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">数据找人交钱很重要，数据找人发钱也挺重要。</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/world-at-work/chinas-booming-gig-economy-masks-job-market-pain-strains-welfare-system-2026-07-06/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">China’s booming gig economy masks job market pain, strains welfare system</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Kmt9_Nf6EZPwzUjPvYU0rd2SuRf4UkmOy5FFWAMFFXeOmCyg9n8C5qxUHnqfd64k71jOca1abXCsIQDVtjHihzYd5N_0dhSI-iuSxpP8BpAOj81YpvJ4_lFhYR5jH0TEP1HDu77qCJp3TfvmaeD3QMW7aciFcxUv-_GobqKO0gHG8DLIyDbSJCHWjMIoOwQiYHqe1dq_HosaiOEshBzOylYWPhpOLeV5605gIysKL9i3IOcFolNcZ9JLFRwFQLDCzI3YCbIfFqVbxX2Y4kpL-6wJDp9HrujYq3RPjSJItxFqY3PaYxwx7AmIFIpvtQjbdInzVwFDA6IBn2tc31SSng.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/QLIOEvDyKMnlKGvPCI6xf3izuG_baWCUu8utv_t0LibWdtLQ3lWiQI1hqzWfpqyrPrkzwC65L6dRcpKPKqRs48Sc-NZnYHIOI1aGQ9VLe1LranZN9EuZmGUyroOrUrxcoywnjH-xfS254WxxGKawIlAgCj8sQ6k8rjw0ua1YVzDep3Qx7WeKvYQ2PNxmby1GQH93MvFLF9z9q_4LQ4WPWy6Gtu2qiWAP83Rg7BjOSmZOMHDDL2P2gOt8Z7Ke1S3hL2MZJBASwOT9UvaG6ehEX0HXy2h-ujWKoZTgDo-VTJ01z9GMxEM8P2cqYXDT9vNuvaOi091gshNNUwtF0J7wqQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/XoC89yeCtiWtgnbPOJTU11rQO4rM0mNZfH7rTlzPfxA35JEyD2ujEfC3bb09SmwetftIDqRoD42A_2FWuHhHed_HQUZlDKP4Rz7StfBUPJDgztzyzpCzC24YYu1l0_MU04kc9j2Zsn1aqO1AJlq4eIQ_I2y91Av26jpVqHGuiRF-8Ra1UW6UbKi7X_qU9HFAnzLKFx7hgNWUjL-9osO8MVnTLolikVHxnGn2yyRTP_00q20AyhhM7_mhpq0h_SPxs9yr_wShU_4bbBjLTscOpxc5ydhRcF14V-39h6F1EytHxQYnjUCB7Tx-w3359FAsRHVJhQLgGK-NxTVKYgybdg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/hbHC6rbTsp9Wb8jDY9cYQ504QICzkxA9P4G0_ezdlwl_WkEvCQuN9YWIJ3tDnuGsgpTAmFgCnP5gpbR7wJGJE-d0HGFhfD4_iUCCgtIEicy--j4vPUj1P3X-H1GNS0xyIM9e05XU-Hj8lRmXhqG8mxpyjrdBVRx8NVUDxyJSd5yl8y-Dxtv44kaiWlRNlGhqRfmihO1sxmrqKkq5pR1nUtBjNE4vfZ93d5Th6SKRnMXk_drnJsCdZzAIJdoF67W52AuhJ8vPJ5tPEF9tuvrDdL7FVlTnBD0y_TkRzFeC7nhr6C7YaOHDOEYJW-A9O8Vy9gzcra0cmJ8D7Xpbq5lwkg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><im